  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{申請|しんせい}する (to apply, to file an application)\n・{申請|しんせい}{書|しょ} (application form)\n・{申請|しんせい}{手続|てつづ}き (application procedure)\n・{申請|しんせい}を{受|う}け{付|つ}ける (to accept applications)\n・{申請|しんせい}{中|ちゅう} (application pending)\n\nCOMMON TYPES:\n・ビザ{申請|しんせい} (visa application)\n・{許可|きょか}{申請|しんせい} (permit application)\n・{補助金|ほじょきん}{申請|しんせい} (subsidy application)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{申|もう}し{込|こ}み - application (less formal, for services/events)\n・{願書|がんしょ} - application form (especially for school admission)\n・{届|とど}け{出|で} - notification, report (required filing)\n\n[Register: Formal]",
